================================================================
4. CHARITY CLAUSE (IMPORTANT — ADDITIONAL TO MIT)
   慈善回馈条款（重要 · 非 MIT 附加条款）
================================================================

4.1 SCOPE / 适用范围
    Any individual or entity that uses the Software (or a
    modified version or derivative work thereof) for any
    "Commercial Purpose" is subject to this Section.

    任何将本软件（或其修改版、衍生作品）用于「商业用途」的
    个人或实体，均适用本条。

4.2 DEFINITION OF "COMMERCIAL PURPOSE" / 「商业用途」的定义
    Including but not limited to: selling, renting, or charging
    a license fee for the Software as a product or part of a
    product; providing the Software as a paid service; using the
    Software internally within a for-profit organization to
    support its profit-making activities; using the Software
    for the purpose of sales, advertising, promotion, or
    obtaining commercial benefit.

    包括但不限于：将本软件作为产品或产品的一部分出售、出租、
    许可收费；将本软件作为付费服务提供；在盈利性组织内部使用
    本软件以支持其营利活动；将本软件用于销售、广告、推广或
    获取商业利益的目的。

4.3 CHARITY CONTRIBUTION OBLIGATION / 慈善回馈义务
    A Commercial User shall donate not less than 1% (one
    percent) of the "Attributable Net Proceeds" obtained
    through its use of the Software to a duly registered
    charitable organization, or apply such amount to a
    recognized public-interest charitable cause.

    商业使用者须将因使用本软件而获得的「相关净收益」的
    不低于 1%（百分之一），捐赠给依法注册的公益慈善
    组织，或用于公认的公益慈善事业。

    Attributable Net Proceeds = revenue attributable, directly
    or indirectly, to the Software, minus direct costs
    reasonably incurred in generating such revenue.

    相关净收益 = 直接或间接归因于本软件的营业收入
                减去为该部分收入所合理发生的直接成本。

4.4 MANNER OF PERFORMANCE / 履行方式
    (a) The recipient must be a legally established non-profit
        charitable institution, public-interest foundation, or
        a recognized public-interest cause such as education,
        healthcare, environmental protection, poverty relief,
        or disaster relief;
    (b) The donation may take the form of money, goods of
        equivalent value, or unpaid services;
    (c) The donation must be completed within 12 months after
        the end of each fiscal year;
    (d) The Commercial User shall disclose its fulfillment of
        the charitable donation in a reasonable manner through
        its public channels (website, documentation, or product
        description).

    (a) 捐赠对象须为依法设立的非营利慈善机构、公益基金会，
        或用于教育、医疗、环保、扶贫、救灾等公认公益事业；
    (b) 捐赠可采取货币、等值物资或无偿服务的形式；
    (c) 捐赠行为应在每个会计年度结束后 12 个月内完成；
    (d) 商业使用者应在其公开渠道（网站、文档或产品说明）
        以合理方式披露其慈善捐赠的履行情况。

4.5 SMALL-SCALE EXEMPTION / 规模豁免
    A micro Commercial User whose annual revenue is less than
    CNY 100,000 (or equivalent in foreign currency) is exempt
    from the obligation under Section 4.3, but must still
    comply with all other terms of this license.

    年营业收入低于人民币 10 万元（或等值外币）的微型商业
    使用者，免除第 4.3 条的慈善回馈义务，但仍须遵守本许可
    证的其他全部条款。

4.6 BURDEN OF PROOF / 举证责任
    Upon reasonable request by the author or copyright holder,
    a Commercial User shall provide reasonable evidence of
    its fulfillment of the donation (such as donation receipts
    or receipts from a public-interest institution). This
    license does not require a Commercial User to disclose its
    complete financial accounts.

    在被作者或版权持有人合理要求时，商业使用者应提供捐赠
    履行的合理证明（如捐赠凭证、公益机构收据等）。本许可证
    不要求商业使用者公开其完整财务账目。

4.7 CONSEQUENCE OF BREACH / 违反后果
    Failure to fulfill the charity contribution obligation
    under this Section 4 constitutes a breach of this license.
    In such event, all rights granted to that Commercial User
    under this license terminate automatically, and such user
    may not continue to use, copy, distribute, or modify the
    Software without separate written permission from the author.

    未履行第 4 条的慈善回馈义务，即构成对本许可证的违约。
    此时，该商业使用者依据本许可证获得的全部授权自动终止，
    未获作者另行书面许可前，不得继续使用、复制、分发或修改
    本软件。

